<section class="wrap easter-egg" id="game"><details id="game-details"><summary><span class="game-promo"><span class="eyebrow">Ready to play?</span><b>PM Runner</b><span class="muted">Outrun deadlines, jump over bugs and collect coffee.</span></span><span class="game-cta"><span class="game-cta-play">Play <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span><span class="game-cta-close">Collapse <span aria-hidden="true">−</span></span></span></summary><div class="game-content"><p>Jump over bugs and deadlines. Space, ↑ or tap to jump. Double jump is available. Coffee adds 10 points.</p><div class="game__layout"><div><div class="game__hud"><span>Score: <b id="g-score">0</b></span><span>Best: <b id="g-hi">0</b></span><span id="g-speed">Speed: normal</span><button id="g-pause" class="text-link" hidden>Pause</button></div><div class="game__stage"><canvas id="g-canvas" width="700" height="200" tabindex="0" aria-label="PM Runner. Space or Up to jump. Escape to pause."></canvas><div class="game__overlay" id="g-overlay"><p class="game__title">PM Runner</p><button class="button primary" id="g-start">Start sprint</button></div></div><p id="g-status" class="game-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></div><aside class="board"><h3>Top players</h3><div id="lb-list"><p>The leaderboard loads when you open the game.</p></div></aside></div><noscript>The game requires JavaScript.</noscript></div></details></section>